stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  05 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 17 48 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number only  is a 7 x 6 x 2cm fragment of fibrofatty breast tissue which is oriented with two sutures  The long stitch marks the medial border  the short stitch marks the area where the specimen was bivalved  There are multiple palpable nodules within the breast tissue which on cut section are firm  white nodules  many of which are well circumscribed  however  others are ill defined and grossly are present at the margin  The largest area is 3 x 3 x 1 4cm in dimension within it is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm firm  round brown nodule which is 0 6cm from the nearest inked margin  Representative section of firm  large 3 x 3 x 1 4cm area submitted in A  There is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm hemorrhagic  white firm area grossly present at the margin  Representative section in cassette B  In addition  there is a 1 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm well circumscribed brown nodule  tan white in color  Representative sections are in cassette C  Cassette D contains another representative section of that large 3 x 3 x 1 4cm area with a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm cystic lesion which contains tan brown  serous fluid  Cassette E contains a representative section of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm firm area which on cut section is white and grossly abuts the margin  This area is adjacent to the region marked by the short suture  Labeled with the patient s name and unit number only is a REMOVED_DATE x 6 x 0 6cm fragment of fibrofatty tissue with multiple lymph nodes within it  Lymph nodes range in size from 0 3cm in greatest dimension to 1 5cm  Representative sections of each node or entire node are submitted in cassettes F through H  Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Lawrence T Geoghegan  M D  PART A  RIGHT BREAST EXCISION PART B  RIGHT AXILLARY LYMPH NODES   report_end  , Positive.
