iled to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  27 MAY 97 at 15 35 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast mass   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm portion of fibroadipose tissue  which is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm tan white stellate firm mass very close to the inked resection margin  The remainder of the parenchyma is unremarkable  The majority of the specimen is submitted in cassettes A H  with the nodule in cassettes C D  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  MARISA BALDASSANO  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LEFT BREAST MASS  EXCISION  SUSPICIOUS FOR INFILTRATING CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  ESTHER OLIVA  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Suzanne B  Keel  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Positive.
