ed to stain lacked the receptors  THE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR PROGESTERONE RECEPTOR PROTEIN ARE FOR INVESTIGATIONAL USE ONLY  THEY MUST NOT BE USED FOR CLINICAL PURPOSES  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  17 REMOVED_MONTH 95 at 16 34 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right breast  is an unoriented REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm portion of tan yellow fibroadipose tissue which is inked and sectioned to reveal an unremarkable breast parenchyma  None frozen  Submitted in toto in A through G  Resident  Ajit J  Alles  MD  PhD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  NO GROSSLY SUSPICIOUS LESION IS LARGE ENOUGH TO FREEZE  O R  Resident  JAMES J  TIESINGA  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Michael Pins  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Frederick William Ackroyd  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST   report_end  , Positive.
