me unit number and  right breast lesion   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 7cm piece of fibrofatty tissue with a localizing wire at one edge  Inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm hard gritty tan nodule which focally abuts closest surgical resection margin  A representative section is frozen and saved frozen  representative sections are saved for BRDU and ER  The remaining non frozen tissue is submitted entirely A  nodule  through I  Resident  Metin Ozdemirli  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  COLLOID CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Jason Lockridge  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Ben Zion Pilch  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST LESION   report_end  , Negative.
