ay  and 97  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  THE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR PROGESTERONE RECEPTOR PROTEIN ARE FOR INVESTIGATIONAL USE ONLY  THEY MUST NOT BE USED FOR CLINICAL PURPOSES  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  02 REMOVED_MONTH 93 at 13 06 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  Left breast mass   is a 3 x 2 x 1 2cm piece of fibrofatty tissue with a localizing wire  The specimen is inked and sectioned  revealing a firm  gray area  REMOVED_DATE x 1 x 0 5cm  abutting the margin at one pole  A representative section is frozen as Frozen Section  1 and submitted in A  The remaining tissue is submitted entirely in B through D  Resident  Metin Ozdemirli  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  LEFT  BIOPSY  CARCINOMA  SUSPICIOUS FOR NEUROENDOCRINE CARCINOMA  INVADING LOBULES  AWAIT PERMANENTS  O R  Resident  Jo Ann E  Haney  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Eugene Jerome Mark  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Stephen Bowman Trippel  M D  Leslie Wayne Ottinger  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST MASS   report_end  , Positive.
