inding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  29 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 09 46     RECEPTOR IMMUNOHISTOCHEMISTRY Addendum     THIS ADDENDUM HAS BEEN DELETED FOR THIS REPORT GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  and unit number  and  right breast mass   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm yellow pink fibroadipose tissue  Inked and sectioned to reveal a stellate white  firm mass with a gritty cut surface abutting the inked margin  The mass is entirely submitted in A D  Representative sections of grossly negative tissue are submitted in cassette E  Resident  JUSTIN M  CATES  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  BREAST  RIGHT   SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASIVE CARCINOMA  LESION TOO SMALL TO FREEZE  AWAIT PERMANENTS  O R  Resident  HOWARD CHANG  MD O R  Diagnosis by  H  Thomas Aretz  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Positive.
