node is sectioned and submitted entirely in cassettes E and F  The smaller fragment of tissue is sectioned to reveal a single lymph node  0 8cm in greatest dimension  submitted entirely in cassette G  Labeled  left axillary non sentinel node  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue sectioned to reveal a single lymph node  1 0cm in greatest dimension  submitted entirely in cassette H  Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA SENTINEL   EXCISION PART C  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA NON SENTINEL   EXCISION   report_end  , Positive.
