 to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  24 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 15 25 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast mass  is a 3 x REMOVED_DATE x 1cm breast biopsy  Inked and sectioned to reveal a 0 6cm in maximum diameter white gray  well circumscribed nodule within 0 2cm of the closest inked resection margin  The specimen is submitted entirety in cassettes A through I  with nodule in A and B  Resident  DAVID SABLE  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS   LEFT BREAST   SUSPICIOUS NODULE  TOO SMALL TO FREEZE  O R  Resident  EDI BROGI  MD  PhD O R  Diagnosis by  Andrew Eric Rosenberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Carlos Fernandez del castillo  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Positive.
