ned with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  THE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR PROGESTERONE RECEPTOR PROTEIN ARE FOR INVESTIGATIONAL USE ONLY  THEY MUST NOT BE USED FOR CLINICAL PURPOSES  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  23 REMOVED_MONTH 95 at 08 16 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  and unit number only  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 4cm fragment  inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm tan pink  firm  stellate mass abutting the inked resection margin  No frozen done  The nodule is submitted entirely in A and B and the remainder of specimen in C through J  Resident  STEPHEN LAU  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS    RIGHT BREAST   LESION GROSSLY SUSPICIOUS FOR CARCINOMA BUT TOO SMALL TO FROZEN     1CM   O R  Resident  FANG FANG  MD  PhD O R  Diagnosis by  Ben Zion Pilch  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST  BIOPSY   report_end  , Positive.
